        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Controller assesses macro risks: Philippine construction sector outlook, interest rate trends, government infrastructure spending, competitor health; adjusts portfolio risk appetite and sector concentration limits
Responsible (R): Finance Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 days/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2483_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
