      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual insurance review or portfolio change
Frequency: Annual; ~PHP 15–20B in insured receivables
Volume: Annual review + ad-hoc for significant changes
Owner: Finance Controller
Participants: Finance Dir, Insurance Broker, CFO
Source: workflow W2484 — Trade Credit Insurance Policy Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
