      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2484_Task4" name="Finance Controller reviews credit insurance policy: coverage adequacy, premium…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Controller reviews credit insurance policy: coverage adequacy, premium vs. claims experience, policy terms (deductible, exclusions, country limits), insurer financial strength; recommends renewal or re-marketing
Responsible (R): Finance Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 3–5 days/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2484_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
