Frequency: Monthly; ~5,400 accounts
Volume: ~5,400 accounts analyzed/month
Owner: Credit Analyst
Participants: Credit Analyst, Finance Dir, CFO
Source: workflow W2485 — Portfolio Risk Concentration Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
