      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2485_Task4" name="System analyzes portfolio concentration: by customer tier, by industry, by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System analyzes portfolio concentration: by customer tier, by industry, by geographic region, by account age; flags concentrations exceeding policy limits (e.g., single customer &gt;5% of portfolio); recommends diversification
Responsible (R): System / Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 2–3 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2485_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
